The integrations table doesn't list Sentry, so an incident agent has no
example to follow for reading errors and stack traces there. Apply the
PagerDuty triage pattern to Sentry's official hosted MCP server. The
token stays in the environment, and skills=inspect leaves out the
tools that update issues.

Replay date: 2026-09-25, the day Sentry MCP v0.42.0 shipped.
Source: https://github.com/getsentry/toolkit/releases/tag/0.42.0
